// HZM coop - BUILD MODE placeable SOUND EMITTERS catalog aliases.
// Any ubersound/*.scr is AUTO-REGISTERED at map init (same as coop_audio.scr / coop_deathvox.scr).
// All aliases use maps "m e t dm obj train" (prefix-matches EVERY campaign + dm/obj/train map) so a
// placed emitter is never silenced by the stock map-gating. Wavs are stock base-pak sounds.
// Emitter recipe (coop_mod/buildmode_sounds.scr): spawn script_model + "fx/dummy.tik" + loopsound
// <alias> <vol> <minDist>  (NO "levelwide" => keeps 3D distance falloff; heard by ALL players via
// the replicated entity loopSound state). One-shots use playsound on a timer. soundparms order:
//   soundparms <baseVol> <randVol> <basePitch> <randPitch> <minDist> <maxDist> auto loaded

// ===== AMBIENCE / NATURE (loops) =====
aliascache coop_snd_wind_trees   sound/amb/Amb_WindTrees3.wav    soundparms 0.6 0.0 1.0 0.0 400 4000 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
aliascache coop_snd_wind_strong  sound/amb/wind_strong.wav       soundparms 0.8 0.0 1.0 0.0 300 5000 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
aliascache coop_snd_wind_weak    sound/amb/wind_weak.wav         soundparms 0.5 0.0 1.0 0.0 400 4000 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
aliascache coop_snd_crickets     sound/amb/Amb_Cricket.wav       soundparms 0.5 0.1 0.95 0.1 200 2000 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"

